	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With a sharp eye and steady hands, you prepare yourself to draw and fire in one smooth motion. You may ready an attack with a firearm that is currently holstered and expend exertion to use this ability only if the readied action is triggered. If you do, make your ranged attack roll with advantage. If both rolls would hit your target, you treat the attack as a critical hit. If one of the dice is a natural 20, you deal a triple damage critical hit. If both dice come up with natural 20s, you deal a quadruple damage critical hit.</p>",
